<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BHP in US$650 mln Venezuelan iron plan.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BHP in US$650 mln Venezuelan iron plan.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd (BHP) said on Friday it and its Venezuelan partner S.A.C.A. had decided to build a hot briquetted iron (HBI) plant in Venezuela.</p>
<p>The plant would cost US$650 million to build and BHP's contribution to the project would be US$160 million, BHP said.</p>
</text>
